The missing staff worked for expedition organisers Himalayan Holidays Nepal and Imagine Nepal Treks, which lost contact with them after the avalanche struck.

"One of the expedition members telephoned and informed that their friends had gone missing after the avalanche hit the base camp," an official at the association said.

